+### Formulas
+- Extinction: $extinction = transferSample.a \times uExtinction$ [S1, unofficial].
+- Alpha contribution: $\alpha = 1.0 - \exp(-extinction \times uSliceDistance)$ [S1, unofficial].
+- Color contribution: $color = transferSample.rgb \times prevOcclusion \times \alpha$ [S1, unofficial].
+- Output color blending: $oColor.rgb = prevColor.rgb + color \times (1.0 - prevColor.a)$ and $oColor.a = \min(prevColor.a + \alpha, 1.0)$ [S1, unofficial].
